{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-02 07:36:06 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: read_search_error_ux] Created agent report card: AGENT_REPORT_CARD_Scribe_unknown_20260202_0736.md | action=create; agent=ResearchAgent; agent_id=Scribe; agent_name=Scribe; body=# Agent Report Card: ResearchAgent  ## [2026-02-02   Stage 1 Review   read_search_error_ux]  **Grade:** 96/100 \u2705   **Stage:** 1 (Research)   **Project:** read_search_error_ux   **Reviewer:** ReviewAgent-ReadSearchUX-Final    ### Category Scores - Research Quality: 100/100 - Accuracy: 100/100 - Evidence Strength: 95/100 - Relevance: 95/100  ### Performance Summary Excellent research quality. Thorough investigation of existing error handling patterns, formatter integration points, and performance considerations. All code references were accurate and verifiable. Research documents provided clear context for architecture and implementation phases.  ### Deductions - **-4 points:** Did not identify formatter display layer as separate integration concern. Research assumed adding enriched fields to response dict would automatically display in error box formatting, missing that ResponseFormatter.format_error() would need updates to render the new fields.  ### Commendations - Comprehensive investigation of existing codebase patterns - Accurate code references with line numbers - Performance considerations well-researched - Clear documentation of findings  ### Teaching Notes When researching error handling and UX improvements, remember to trace the full data flow from error generation \u2192 response dict \u2192 formatter display. Adding fields to a response dict doesn't guarantee they'll be displayed - the formatter layer may need explicit updates to render new fields. Consider testing the full user-facing display during research phase, not just verifying the data is present in responses.  **Verdict:** PASS (\u226593% required) ; doc=agent_report_card; doc_type=agent_card; document_type=agent_report_card; file_path=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_search_error_ux/AGENT_REPORT_CARD_Scribe_unknown_20260202_0736.md; file_size=3598; project_name=read_search_error_ux; project_root=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp; section=; stage=unknown; timestamp=2026-02-02 07:36:06 UTC; priority=medium; log_type=doc_updates; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_search_error_ux/DOC_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T07:36:06.308212+00:00_f13e0971", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T07:36:06.308287+00:00"}
